## 5. Comprehensive RAG Knowledge Base (Frequently Asked Questions)

### Horology & Watches
**Q: Are all watches guaranteed authentic?**  
A: Yes, without exception. {{ shop.name }} employs seasoned watchmakers who verify each component, movement caliber, serial number, and accompanying documentation before any timepiece is presented for sale.

**Q: Do watches come with their original box and papers?**  
A: Full sets (original box, warranty card, booklets, and tags) are indicated on each product page. In cases where vintage or pre-owned pieces lack original papers, a certificate of authenticity and provenance guarantee from {{ shop.name }} is provided.

**Q: How does the consignment / trade-in process work?**  
A: Clients can send photos and details of their timepiece via WhatsApp to `+62 813-1100-0909`. Our specialists provide an estimated market appraisal within hours. Upon physical inspection at our showroom or via secure courier, we agree on a reserve price and list the piece across our network.

### Diamonds & Jewelry
**Q: Are lab-grown diamonds cubic zirconia or moissanite?**  
A: No. Lab-grown diamonds are 100% real diamonds. Cubic zirconia and moissanite are diamond simulants made of different chemical compounds with distinct refractive and hardness properties. Lab-grown diamonds pass all diamond testing pens and gemological spectral analysis because they are pure carbon diamonds.

**Q: Are the diamonds certified?**  
A: Yes. High-grade lab-grown diamonds at {{ shop.name }} come with official grading certificates from internationally recognized institutions (such as IGI or GIA), documenting precise carat weight, color, clarity, and cut proportions.

**Q: Can I order a custom engagement ring or bespoke jewelry?**  
A: Yes. Clients can collaborate directly with our jewelry team to select a loose certified diamond and customize the ring setting (18k White Gold, Yellow Gold, Rose Gold, or Platinum). Production includes 3D CAD rendering approval before casting and setting.

